# Cloudflare serves a matching static asset *before* the Worker runs, so a
# redirect written in src/ for a path that used to be a page is never reached —
# that has already been tried here once and silently did nothing. This file is
# how the asset server itself is told, and it is evaluated before
# not_found_handling serves the 404 page.

# The paste-your-JSON page was /custom until it was renamed. Anything already
# linking to the old address keeps working, and 301 tells search engines to move
# whatever ranking it had rather than treating the new URL as a new page.
/custom /createMockServer 301
/custom.html /createMockServer 301
